      ],
      "text": "Urinalysis and usually imaging"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " for suspected renal colic; once a stone is confirmed, look for the cause, including stone composition."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
